{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/worldmodule"]}],"metadata":{"externalID":"WorldModule","modules":[{"name":"WorldModule"}],"roleHeading":"Framework","symbolKind":"module","role":"collection","title":"WorldModule"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Entity","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Component","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Resource"],"anchor":"Essentials","title":"Essentials"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Bundle","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/BundleBuilder","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/TupleBundle","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/EitherBundle"],"anchor":"Grouping-Components","title":"Grouping Components"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryingAWorld","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Query","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryView","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/EntityQueryView","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryRow","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryTerm","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/AnyOf","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/EntitiesView"],"anchor":"Querying-and-Updating-Entities","title":"Querying and Updating Entities"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryFilter","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/FilterTerm","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/With","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Without","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Added","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Changed","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Allows"],"anchor":"Filtering-Queries","title":"Filtering Queries"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/GroupError"],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Groups are made with "},{"code":"group(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", cached queries with "},{"code":"cache(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and indexes by value with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"index(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" on "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World"},{"type":"text","text":"; "},{"code":"lookup(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" finds the entities holding a value, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"lookup(_:equals:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" the entities whose property at a key path equals one."}],"anchor":"Speeding-Up-Queries","title":"Speeding Up Queries"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Commands"],"anchor":"Deferring-Changes","title":"Deferring Changes"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Resources"],"anchor":"Working-with-Resources","title":"Working with Resources"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/ChangeTick","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/RemovedComponent"],"anchor":"Detecting-Changes-and-Removals","title":"Detecting Changes and Removals"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Disabled","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Prefab"],"anchor":"Disabling-Entities-and-Using-Prefabs","title":"Disabling Entities and Using Prefabs"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/ChildOf","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/AncestorsView","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/DescendantsView","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/CyclicHierarchy","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/HierarchyError"],"anchor":"Building-Hierarchies","title":"Building Hierarchies"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Relation","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Targets","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/CleanupAction"],"anchor":"Relating-Entities","title":"Relating Entities"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Event","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Events","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/EventsView"],"anchor":"Sending-Events","title":"Sending Events"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/EntityEvent","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Trigger"],"abstract":[{"text":"Hooks are registered with ","type":"text"},{"code":"onAdd","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"onInsert","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"onRemove","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" on ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", for a component type","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"or a query. Observers are registered with ","type":"text"},{"code":"observe","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"anchor":"Reacting-to-Changes-with-Hooks-and-Observers","title":"Reacting to Changes with Hooks and Observers"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/SavingAndLoadingWorlds","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/WorldSnapshot","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Scene","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/TypeRegistry","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/TypeRegistryError","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/TypeRegistryLookupError","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/MapEntities"],"anchor":"Saving-and-Loading-Worlds","title":"Saving and Loading Worlds"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Access","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/ConcurrentChange"],"anchor":"Running-Changes-Concurrently","title":"Running Changes Concurrently"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/StaleEntity","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/MissingComponent","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/MissingResource"],"anchor":"Errors","title":"Errors"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Swift"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Extended-Modules","title":"Extended Modules"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"WorldModule is built around a "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", a value that holds everything your game or simulation"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"knows. The world organizes that state with a few simple ideas:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"entity","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" is one thing in the world, such as a ball, a player or a particle. It has no data"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of its own; you refer to it by its handle, an "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Entity","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"component"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" is a plain value that an entity holds, such as a position or a health total."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Any type that conforms to "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Component","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" can be a component, and an entity holds at most one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"component of each type."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"resource"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" is a value the world holds once, outside any entity, such as a clock or a score.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Any type that conforms to ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Resource","type":"reference"},{"text":" can be a resource.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The examples throughout this module’s documentation use these components:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["struct Position: Component { var x: Double, y: Double }","struct Velocity: Component { var dx: Double, dy: Double }","struct Health: Component { var current: Int }","struct Frozen: Component {}","struct Name: Component, Hashable { var value: String }"]},{"text":"Spawn Entities and Work with Their Components","level":3,"anchor":"Spawn-Entities-and-Work-with-Their-Components","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Spawn an entity with the components it starts with. The world returns the entity’s handle, which"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"you use to read and change its components:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["var world = World()","let hero = world.spawn(Name(value: \"Ada\"), Position(x: 0, y: 0), Health(current: 100))","","world[Health.self, of: hero].current -= 30","world.insert(Velocity(dx: 1, dy: 0), into: hero)","world.remove(Position.self, from: hero)","","print(world[Health.self, of: hero].current)","\/\/ Prints \"70\""]},{"text":"Query and Update Many Entities","level":3,"anchor":"Query-and-Update-Many-Entities","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Most of the work in a game applies to every entity that holds some set of components: every","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"entity with a position and a velocity moves, every entity with health can take damage. A query","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"visits those entities and reads their components, and an update changes one component of each in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"place:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["var world = World()","world.spawn(Position(x: 0, y: 0), Velocity(dx: 1, dy: 0))","world.spawn(Position(x: 5, y: 5), Velocity(dx: 0, dy: -1), Frozen())","","world.update(Position.self, reading: Velocity.self, where: .without(Frozen.self)) { position, row in","    position.x += row.components.dx","    position.y += row.components.dy","}","","var coordinates: [(Double, Double)] = []","for (_, position) in world.query(Position.self) {","    coordinates.append((position.x, position.y))","}","print(coordinates)","\/\/ Prints \"[(1.0, 0.0), (5.0, 5.0)]\""]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Filters such as ","type":"text"},{"code":".without(Frozen.self)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" narrow which entities a query or update visits. To learn","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"more, see ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryingAWorld","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Defer Structural Changes with Commands","level":3,"anchor":"Defer-Structural-Changes-with-Commands","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"While a query or update is visiting entities, you can’t spawn or despawn entities or add and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"remove their components. Record those changes in "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Commands"},{"type":"text","text":" instead, and apply them when the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"visit is over:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["var world = World()","world.spawn(Health(current: 0))","world.spawn(Health(current: 40))","","var commands = Commands()","for (entity, health) in world.query(Health.self) where health.current <= 0 {","    commands.despawn(entity)","}","world.apply(commands)","","print(world.count)","\/\/ Prints \"1\""]},{"text":"Keep World-Wide State in Resources","level":3,"anchor":"Keep-World-Wide-State-in-Resources","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A resource holds state that belongs to the whole world rather than to any entity:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["struct Elapsed: Resource { var seconds: Double }","","var world = World()","world.resources.insert(Elapsed(seconds: 0))","world.resources[Elapsed.self].seconds += 0.5","","print(world.resources[Elapsed.self].seconds)","\/\/ Prints \"0.5\""]},{"text":"Copy Worlds Freely","level":3,"anchor":"Copy-Worlds-Freely","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A world is a value: assigning it to another variable makes an independent copy. Copies share"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"storage until one of them changes, so copying is cheap, and keeping an earlier state for undo, a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"replay or a comparison takes one assignment."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"abstract":[{"text":"Store the state of a game or simulation as entities and components, and read and change it with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"queries, updates, and commands.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"references":{"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/AnyOf":{"title":"AnyOf","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/anyof","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/AnyOf","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AnyOf","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"A group of types an entity matches by matching at least one of them.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"AnyOf","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/World/addChild(_:checkedTo:)":{"title":"addChild(_:checkedTo:)","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/addChild(_:checkedTo:)","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/world\/addchild(_:checkedto:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Adds an entity to the end of another entity’s children, throwing if either entity is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stale."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"addChild"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule6EntityV","text":"Entity","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"checkedTo","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule6EntityV","text":"Entity","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule14HierarchyErrorO","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"HierarchyError"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/ChildOf":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ChildOf"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/ChildOf","title":"ChildOf","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"ChildOf"}],"